      },
      "message": "test(gate): split the rotary parity and STEP agreement tests (#1715)\n\nThe rotary parity test ran three parity checks and three eye costs in\nseries (768 s in release). It is six tests now, one for each kind and\nmeasure, with the same bodies and the same heavy-lane name.\n\nThe STEP agreement bench read 14 files in a serial loop (90 s in\ndebug). It is one test for each file now (9.3 s), plus the file-set\ntest that keeps \"a file with no row fails the bench\".\n\nRefs #1715\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
